{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgEPL3rt81AC7JCBJhb2X","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fixed the integration. There were three separate bugs, and each one alone was enough to break connecting. The causes and fixes are written up in `ANSWER.md`.\n\n1. **The Connect button always got 401.** The button was a plain link. Following a link doesn't send the sign-in token, which the app keeps in the browser and only attaches to its own fetch calls. Now the button asks the server for the Intervals login URL with a fetch call (a POST that includes the token) and then sends the browser there.\n2. **Intervals rejected the request with 400 `invalid_request`.** The permission list asked for read and write on the same area (e.g. `CALENDAR:READ,CALENDAR:WRITE`). On Intervals, write already includes read, and naming an area twice gets the request rejected. That's why pasting the link stopped working once calendar sync shipped. The list is now `ACTIVITY:WRITE,WELLNESS:READ,CALENDAR:WRITE`.\n3. **Rivera was told to reconnect after an hour.** Intervals tokens don't expire until the athlete revokes access, and there's no refresh token. The code assumed a one-hour lifetime, then threw the token away when it couldn't refresh it. Now a token with no stated expiry is kept, and the connection is only marked \"expired, reconnect\" when Intervals actually returns 401.\n\n**Testing:** I ran the whole connect flow against a fake Intervals server I wrote, and it works end to end. Connecting succeeds, wellness data loads, and a token with no expiry stays connected through the background refresh. I couldn't test against the real intervals.icu.\n\n**Port conflict:** a `server.py` you already had running (PID 93026) holds port 8766. I left it alone and tested a copy on port 8767 instead. Restart yours to pick up the changes.\n\n**After deploying:** Rivera needs to click Connect once more, because the old code already deleted their token. Everything is uncommitted."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":138,"cache_read_input_tokens":43826,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":138},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8be47a90-2f7b-4aee-aba8-b973aef40035","uuid":"23d6fe0d-6fae-4264-ba9f-30224746072d","timestamp":"2026-10-20T23:50:33.951Z","request_id":"req_011CgEPL3czhiKqkTaCCnQ95"}
